WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.544 --> 00:00:04.045
Yikes! Who are you?

2
00:00:04.225 --> 00:00:05.885
I'm a scorpion.

3
00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:11.167
are arachnids.

4
00:00:11.187 --> 00:00:15.288
Those are creatures with eight legs.

5
00:00:32.288 --> 00:00:33.369
Where do you live?

6
00:00:33.389 --> 00:00:37.811
Scorpions live all over the world.

7
00:00:40.353 --> 00:00:42.674
Some live in forests or grasslands.

8
00:00:44.415 --> 00:00:45.976
Most live in the desert.

9
00:00:48.578 --> 00:00:49.658
What do you eat?

10
00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:54.541
We like insects, spiders, and snails.

11
00:00:57.003 --> 00:00:58.704
We have big front claws.

12
00:01:03.068 --> 00:01:04.529
Our claws help us hunt.

13
00:01:07.471 --> 00:01:08.992
Do you go underground?

14
00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:14.755
Yes. We burrow in soil or under rocks.

15
00:01:16.396 --> 00:01:18.037
We hide during the day.

16
00:01:19.698 --> 00:01:21.259
We come out after dark.

17
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.941
I see your stinger!

18
00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:30.164
Our stingers are on our tails.

19
00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:33.168
They have venom.

20
00:01:34.689 --> 00:01:37.410
We use venom to poison our enemies.

21
00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:41.831
Who are your enemies?

22
00:01:43.471 --> 00:01:45.752
Scorpions have lots of enemies.

23
00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:50.293
Birds, toads, lizards, and snakes hunt us.

24
00:01:52.134 --> 00:01:54.734
Scorpions sometimes hunt each other!

25
00:01:57.515 --> 00:01:58.695
Do you lay eggs?

26
00:02:00.336 --> 00:02:03.089
No. We give birth to babies.

27
00:02:04.849 --> 00:02:07.210
At first the babies ride on our backs.

28
00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.771
A few weeks later, they leave their mothers.

29
00:02:15.812 --> 00:02:17.553
Here comes a hungry toad.

30
00:02:19.153 --> 00:02:19.953
See you later!

31
00:02:22.494 --> 00:02:23.934
Good-bye, Scorpion!
